  <data>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="40" width="500" height="22">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" color="rgb(0,112,186)" wrap="false"><p>02　总体架构与技术选型</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="62" width="832" height="32">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="25" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" wrap="false">
        <p>技术选型以稳定、透明、可离线演示为原则</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="64" startY="106" endX="896" endY="106"><border color="rgb(210,220,230)" width="1"/></line>

    <table topLeftX="64" topLeftY="126" width="832" height="266">
      <colgroup><col width="148"/><col width="332"/><col width="352"/></colgroup>
      <tr height="28">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(0,48,135,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="center"><p>层次 / 组件</p></content></td>
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(0,48,135,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="left"><p>选型</p></content></td>
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(0,48,135,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="left"><p>选型理由</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>后端框架</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>Spring Boot 2.7.18，内嵌 Tomcat 9（javax.servlet）</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>起步快、内嵌容器、生态成熟，适合课程规模项目</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>数据访问</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>Spring JDBC · JdbcTemplate</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>SQL 直接可控、无 ORM 黑盒，便于讲解与排错</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>认证安全</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>BCryptPasswordEncoder + HttpSession + 登录拦截器</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>密码哈希不落明文；白名单放行只读接口，写操作校验登录态</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>数据库</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>MySQL 8.0，utf8mb4 / utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci / InnoDB</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>完整支持中文，外键与联合唯一索引保证数据一致性</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>前端</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>纯 HTML + CSS + 原生 JavaScript（fetch / FormData）</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>无构建链，静态资源由 Spring Boot 直接托管，共 6 个页面</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>AI 层</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>LLM 适配器 + 规则引擎自动回退</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>预留 OpenAI 兼容接口；无密钥或失败时离线规则引擎兜底</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="34">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)" textAlign="center"><p>文件存储</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>本地 ./uploads 目录 + /uploads/** 静态映射</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" textAlign="left"><p>图片、音频统一落盘，扩展名白名单限制上传类型</p></content></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="404" width="832" height="40">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" color="rgb(71,85,105)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>开发工具：IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.4（内置 Maven 构建）、MySQL 8.0 Command Line Client、Navicat Premium 16（库表可视化管理与数据核对）。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>选型上坚持三点：稳定、透明、可离线演示。后端用 Spring Boot 2.7.18，数据访问用 JdbcTemplate 直接写 SQL；认证用 BCrypt 加 Session；前端不引入框架，纯静态 HTML 加原生 fetch；AI 层做了适配器抽象，默认规则引擎离线运行，配置密钥即可切换真实大模型。开发使用 IDEA、MySQL 命令行和 Navicat。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
